'''Hemlock's office'''<ref name="Databank">{{Databank|hemlock-s-office|Hemlock's office}}</ref> was the private office for [[Royce Hemlock]],<ref name="Identity" /> [[Chief Scientist]] of the [[Advanced Science Division]]<ref name="Tipping Point">{{TBB|Tipping Point}}</ref> in [[Tantiss Base]]<ref name="Identity" /> on the [[planet]]<ref name="TFABG">[[Star Wars: The Force Awakens Beginner Game|''Star Wars: The Force Awakens'' Beginner Game]]</ref> [[Wayland]]. The room was spartan with few decorations other than two pillars in the corners, a desk and three chairs.<ref name="Identity" /> During or after [[18 BBY]],<ref name="Date">{{TBBDate|310}}</ref> Hemlock was contacted by [[Grand Moff]] [[Wilhuff Tarkin]] in this office via [[hologram]] to inquire about his Division's funding.<ref name="Identity" />

